  "migrationAssumptions": [
    "V2 state starts from a fresh deployment; no V1 storage migration is assumed.",
    "V1 journals, addresses, and transaction hashes are not valid V2 session state.",
    "V2 permits one delivery per award so inherited value exits cannot ignore a second delivery.",
    "Non-delivery refunds require the frozen payment policy, trusted deadline, grace period, and buyer dispute resolution.",
    "Stable Studionet storage adapter preserves V2 records in one canonical JSON map."
  ],
